From: Kyle Tanglao <ktanglao@lsu.edu>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 06:39:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Guides: How to Request Research Help page script

Builds an unpublished guide page, owned by Kyle Tanglao, from llms.txt
rewritten for patrons: official records first, what staff can help with,
what they can't do (AI-supplied container numbers, availability, rights
determinations, restricted content, AI summaries and OCR), archival
requests, using AI tools, citing and reuse. Reuses existing Resources by
link. README section added.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Fg7if7FG5dL9B4WrFgSJEn
